<th class="center border-top-single border-bottom-single border-right-single">Helmet/hood</th>
<th class="center border-top-single border-bottom-single">Loose-fitting facepiece</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="left border-right-single">1. Air-Purifying Respirator</td>
