w.federalregister.gov/citation/55-FR-6\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"55 FR 6\"\u003e6-96\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/62-FR-111)\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"62 FR 111)\"\u003e62 FR 111)\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/62-FR-3\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"62 FR 3\"\u003e3-2000\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/65-FR-50017)\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"65 FR 50017)\"\u003e65 FR 50017)\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/65-FR-5\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"65 FR 5\"\u003e5-2002\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/67-FR-65008)\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"67 FR 65008)\"\u003e67 FR 65008)\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/67-FR-5\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"67 FR 5\"\u003e5-2007\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/72-FR-31160)\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"72 FR 31160)\"\u003e72 FR 31160)\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/72-FR-4\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"72 FR 4\"\u003e4-2010\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/75-FR-55355)\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"75 FR 55355)\"\u003e75 FR 55355)\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/75-FR-1\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"75 FR 1\"\u003e1-2012\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/77-FR-3912)\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"77 FR 3912)\"\u003e77 FR 3912)\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/77-FR-08\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"77 FR 08\"\u003e08-2020\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/85-FR-58393)\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"85 FR 58393)\"\u003e85 FR 58393)\u003c/a\u003e, or \u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/85-FR-07\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"85 FR 07\"\u003e07-2025\u003c/a\u003e (\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/90-FR-27878\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"90 FR 27878\"\u003e90 FR 27878\u003c/a\u003e); \u003ca href=\"/current/title-29/part-1911\" class=\"cfr external\"\u003e29 CFR part 1911\u003c/a\u003e; and \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/5/553\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e5 U.S.C. 553\u003c/a\u003e, as applicable.\n"],"source":["\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/39-FR-23502\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"39 FR 23502\"\u003e39 FR 23502\u003c/a\u003e, June 27, 1974, unless otherwise noted.\n","\u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/39-FR-23502\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"39 FR 23502\"\u003e39 FR 23502\u003c/a\u003e, June 27, 1974, unless otherwise noted. Redesignated at \u003ca href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/citation/40-FR-23072\" class=\"fr-reference\" data-reference=\"40 FR 23072\"\u003e40 FR 23072\u003c/a\u003e, May 28, 1975.\n"],"link":"/current/title-29/part-1910","title":"Part 1910"},{"level":"subpart","identifier":"I","label_level":"Subpart I","hierarchy":{"title":"29","subtitle":"B","chapter":"XVII","part":"1910","subpart":"I"},"current":false,"authority":["\u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/29/653\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e29 U.S.C. 653\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/29/655\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e655\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/29/657\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e657\u003c/a\u003e; Secretary of Labor's Or